# SHOPGRAPH — OLLAMA CATEGORY MANAGER COMPLETION UPDATE

## PURPOSE

Update the attached ShopGraph codebase so the current manual Pipeline Export 2 + external AI workflow can be performed locally with Ollama.

Currently the user runs:

```
5. Category Manager Completion
6. Pipeline Export 2
```

Pipeline Export 2 exports:

```
shopgraph_category_manager.txt
shopgraph_category_completion_prompt.txt
shopgraph_purchase_history.txt
```

The user then gives those files to an external AI, receives recommended broad Category assignments for Category Manager rows whose Category is NA, and manually enters those Categories into ShopGraph.

Replace that manual AI step with a local Ollama-powered Category Manager completion capability.

Do NOT remove Pipeline Export 2. Preserve it as a manual fallback.

