```

Do not overwrite the backup until all Ollama results have passed validation.

If an existing ShopGraph backup helper can safely be reused without changing its semantics, reuse it.

Otherwise use a straightforward file copy.

=======================================================
ATOMIC SAVE
===========

Do not save directly over the live workbook in a way that risks corruption.

Follow ShopGraph's existing safe-save philosophy:

1. save to a temporary .xlsx file;
2. reopen the temporary workbook to verify it is readable;
3. atomically replace the live workbook.

If an existing Category Manager helper already provides the correct safe-save behavior, reuse it rather than duplicating it.

=======================================================
POST-WRITE VALIDATION
=====================

After saving:

Reopen the workbook.

Verify that every Category Manager Sub-Category has a valid Category.

Specifically verify that no current Category Manager target remains:

```
Category = NA
```

or blank.

If unresolved rows remain, print them clearly.

Example:

```
[WARNING] Category Manager still contains Sub-Categories without a valid Category.

Rows: 17, 29
```

Do not claim success if unresolved rows remain.

If everything is complete:

```
[OK] Category Manager Category validation passed.
Category Manager rows with blank/NA Category: 0
```

